{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一行的大号文字，尤其是粉色强调的“心里又热了起来”和“还能有那样的相处”；随后容易被第二行的橙红色强调词吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"想起从前自然亲近的日子，重新期待以后还能拥有那样的亲近相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"后来重新有了劲头、不再整天纠结过去；劲头消退后又担心还要等很久；最终希望珍惜以后可能出现的亲近关系，不再委屈自己。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的文字争夺主视线：第一行粉色强调、第二行橙红色强调、第三行紫色强调和第四行绿色强调都比较突出。\",\n    \"独立文字块较多，后面几句呈现的是不同阶段的心理变化，第一眼容易被首句吸引后又转向其他强调内容。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d5ef655-79d6-4499-9a6f-0db1f53a2994", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013754372731Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:38:19.755437+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2719f3f0d242363859c728d237156b7f8cc9408a5699f7a32898b7609eff2fe4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp